	"readme": "# postcss-animate-css-vars\n\nPostCSS plugin for processing animate.css with custom animation options.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Homepage** | https://cssanimation.dev/postcss-animate-css-vars |\n| **Repository** | https://github.com/cssanimation/postcss-animate-css-vars |\n| **Issues** | https://github.com/cssanimation/postcss-animate-css-vars/issues |\n| **Author** | [Alex Rivera](https://cssanimation.dev) · alex@cssanimation.dev |\n| **License** | MIT |\n\n## Features\n\n- Inject custom CSS variables (duration, delay, iteration count)\n- Add `-webkit-` vendor prefixes to animation properties\n- Prefix `@keyframes` for broader browser support\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install postcss-animate-css-vars postcss\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```js\nconst postcss = require('postcss');\nconst animatecss = require('postcss-animate-css-vars');\n\npostcss([\n  animatecss({\n    features: {\n      'custom-properties': {\n        preserve: true,\n        variables: {\n          '--animate-duration': '1.5s',\n          '--animate-delay': '200ms',\n          '--animate-repeat': '2'\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    autoprefixer: {\n      flexbox: 'no-2009'\n    }\n  })\n]).process(css);\n```\n\n## Related\n\n- [tailwind-animate-css-plugin](https://www.npmjs.com/package/tailwind-animate-css-plugin) — Tailwind CSS plugin built on this package\n- [animate.css](https://animate.style/) — the animation library this targets\n\n## Contributing\n\nIssues and PRs welcome at https://github.com/cssanimation/postcss-animate-css-vars.\n\n## License\n\nMIT © [Alex Rivera](https://cssanimation.dev)\n",
